  "label": "Authoritarian Police",
  "description": "A concept referring to police forces that are perceived as acting with excessive force, suppressing civil liberties, and enforcing state control in a repressive manner. The image of police in riot gear is used to symbolize this concept, which is often associated with authoritarian regimes. The meme uses this visual to imply that American police or government are acting like authoritarian forces.",
